<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\アラーム.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>I woke up to my phone's alarm, which I'd used for the first time in a long while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カーテン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\ホテル室内.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened the curtains, the sun shining on Tokyo announced the morning to this room too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a big nnnnn, I stretched out and went over once more in my head what I had to do today.<PG>
...Okay. My jaw, throat and arms, which I'd pushed hard yesterday, and my stomach too, weren't all that tired.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The bit of training in Motoki-cho seemed to have paid off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So what kind of menu would I be competing on today?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\ホテル.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Good morning, contestants! 
{PAUSE ""}
　We'll take you to the venue, so please board the bus."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Following <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="うかい">Ukai</STYLE>-san's directions, I got on the bus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Same as yesterday, I sat next to <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\バス車内椅子.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">“Good morning.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Good morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. Not worn out from yesterday?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">“No, I'm in top condition.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... That's good to hear. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, if you're not at your best, there's no challenge in it for me."</STYLE><PG>
Just then, whispers reached us from all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Heard <STYLE ID="3">that girl</STYLE> sitting up front polished off a 10-pound steak yesterday, no sweat."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"10 pounds!? How are we supposed to beat a monster like that...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Even getting through the qualifier's gonna be tough..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Word of yesterday's results already seemed to be going around.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, your performance yesterday seems to have given you quite a psychological edge."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't much of a performance, but in this <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="かいわい">world</STYLE>, sure enough, word travels fast.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\バス車内.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment the bus set off, Ukai-san stood at the front and took a microphone.<PG>
"Uh, good morning, everyone. 
{PAUSE ""}
We're now heading to the qualifier venue; the qualifier will be held in a special studio at our station. 
{PAUSE ""}
The three who make it through the qualifier will compete in the final at the Shibuya crossing. 
{PAUSE ""}
Note that the qualifier will be broadcast live as well, so―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From there, we got a boring rundown of precautions and the like.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The gist seemed to be: you'll be on TV, so behave with some common sense.<PG>
The scenery flowing past the window was no different from yesterday.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm no more than one grain among the people scattered across this Tokyo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But today, I might show myself before the whole country.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just how much of a diamond's sparkle can this one grain become?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\テレビ局前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before long, we arrived in front of Japonica TV.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The time was 8:30.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How would I spend the hour and a half until the qualifier started?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How I handled my final tuning could set me apart too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were told to wait in a waiting room called the dressing room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\テレビ局楽屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you nervous?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">“Well, of course I am.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... But like I said yesterday, you should think about the final more than the qualifier. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, with your ability you can probably get through the qualifier, but if you burn out there, it'll hit you hard in the final. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Don't let your guard down, but make sure you always keep something in reserve."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-san</STYLE> took out a convenience-store rice ball.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Eating contest or not, if you go in on an empty stomach first thing in the morning, your stomach is sluggish and you can't eat much. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You eat just a little, so your stomach is up and moving. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, would you like one too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-san</STYLE> held out the same kind of rice ball.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">“Thank you very much. Itadakimasu.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\おにぎり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "C" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I took a bite of the pickled-plum rice ball, the kind with no <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="のり">nori</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Saliva spread through my whole mouth, and my half-asleep appetite woke up.<PG>
Yeah, this really does seem to work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Holding back the urge to swallow right away, I <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="か">chewed</STYLE> it well to make it even a little easier to digest, and sent it down to my stomach.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the first time, I could actually feel my stomach start moving and the digestive juices start flowing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... What could the qualifier menu be? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">With 100 people competing, I don't think they'll serve anything complicated. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It should be something portable, easy for the staff to carry around. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The contest menu might even be rice balls."</STYLE><PG>
Something portable, huh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rice balls, to start with, then sandwiches, hamburgers, or the kind of thing they serve at food stalls.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are lots of candidates, but considering the qualifier lasts 30 minutes, it'll probably be something where gaps open easily, in other words, something where it's easy to rack up a count.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So my prediction: nothing that overworks your <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="そしゃく">chewing</STYLE> power or <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="えんげ">swallowing</STYLE> power.<PG>
No. There's a final after this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So stomachs don't get overloaded, they might deliberately pick something hard to eat and hard to swallow...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I start thinking, there's no end to it. I'll stop thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the blood goes to my brain now, it's bad for my stomach.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Having finished the rice ball, I closed my eyes and decided to wait like that until it was time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As if <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めいそう">meditating</STYLE>, I faced my other self.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めいそう">Meditating</STYLE> only in order to eat is something the me of a little while ago couldn't even have imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Days when I coasted through my part-time work and did nothing but eat, sleep, breathe.<PG>
And that same me is now <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めいそう">meditating</STYLE> ahead of the trial that's about to begin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You never know how life will turn out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Out of nowhere, the faces of <STYLE ID="10">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> came back to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the two of them were alive, I wouldn't be in a place like this right now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\証明.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That time, <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had lifted <STYLE ID="10">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> head and was talking to her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That moment is not something I can forget.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, what was the truth of that incident―?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm supposed to have given up on thinking, but now that I'm active again for the first time in ages, my head can't help heading that way.<PG>
Solving that incident now wouldn't change anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone involved died, and I alone survived.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No. If it was a problem between the Kogori family and the Niimura family, then I was probably closer to a bystander.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it might be fair to say that's why I survived.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then who was the culprit?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\古郡家居間死体.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> had been beheaded, and <STYLE ID="12">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE> had a knife stuck in her abdomen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="13">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> lay collapsed, bleeding from the head.<PG>
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of these, only <STYLE ID="13">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> is clearly off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The knife <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> drove into her own neck was the one pulled out of the abdomen of <STYLE ID="12">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, the knife really was stuck in the abdomen of <STYLE ID="12">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE>, so there's no faking that.<PG>
So it would seem that only in the case of <STYLE ID="13">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> could the body have been faked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All it takes is some <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ちのり">fake blood</STYLE> smeared on the head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, the nata had been left at the scene, but the weapon that must have struck the head wasn't there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That would mean the culprit took away only the weapon used on the head, but...<PG>
That really is a little unnatural.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case the culprit would have taken the nata too, and would never have left the Noh mask at the scene either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's as if the things left at the scene were left there on purpose...<PG>
I see. The culprit's aim was to make <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> think it was 'the curse coming true.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just before that, <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had said, 'You wear a Noh mask at memorial services.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaving the Noh mask at the scene would burn the image of death into <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE> mind and make her think the curse had come true.<PG>
All of that is only speculation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, the body of <STYLE ID="13">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> is the only unnatural one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Both the state of the body and the weapon are wrong.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\証明.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, there was what <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">'re still warm,"</STYLE> she'd said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means it was still early enough that body heat remained and rigor mortis hadn't set in.<PG>
In that case, even if <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had touched her <STYLE ID="13">mother's</STYLE> body, she wouldn't have felt anything was off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I went into the Kogori house, <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> may have touched her <STYLE ID="13">mother's</STYLE> body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it looks like her <STYLE ID="13">mother</STYLE> noticed we were coming and hastily faked it.<PG>
The accident, for the culprit, was that <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> killed herself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment <STYLE ID="11">Senpai</STYLE> drove the knife into her throat, the culprit must have rushed to stop it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To keep me from witnessing the moment the suicide was stopped, the culprit knocked me out, hitting me from behind or some such.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But by then, it was already too late.<PG>
Huh... With a little thought, I could have seen both the culprit and the feint aimed at <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though at that point, it would have been too late.<PG>
